# Red Goblin cannot block Knights of Thorn, but can block the other attacker; a colorless Memnite can block the Knights (CR 702.16f).
[Bot1 Deck]
Black Lotus
Mox Pearl
Knights of Thorn
Memnite
Island x20
[Bot2 Deck]
Mountain
Raging Goblin
Memnite
Island x20
[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Memnite.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Black Lotus.Activate(Color: White)
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Pearl.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Knights of Thorn.Cast
? Bot1.Mana =
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Mountain.Play
Bot2.Hand.Memnite.Cast
Bot2.Battlefield.Mountain.Activate
Bot2.Hand.Raging Goblin.Cast
[T3 Bot1.DeclareAttackers]
Bot1.Attack(Knights of Thorn > Bot2; Memnite > Bot2)
Bot1.Choose()
! Bot2.Block(Raging Goblin > Knights of Thorn)
Bot2.Block(Raging Goblin > Bot1.Battlefield.Memnite; Bot2.Battlefield.Memnite > Knights of Thorn)
[T3 Bot1.Main2]
[Expect]
Bot1.Battlefield.Knights of Thorn.Damage = 1
Bot1.Graveyard = Memnite; Black Lotus
Bot2.Graveyard.Count = 2
